# L9e (L9-MESHES): a static mesh laid along each landscape spline segment and bent along its curve (UE
# ULandscapeSplineSegment::SplineMeshes / FLandscapeSplineMeshEntry -> USplineMeshComponent).
# Start: L9.scn's road - three points across the TerrainPlain hill at (6300|9282|12300, -1906).
# The bent meshes are derived from the splines (ECS::LandscapeSplineMeshDraw), so drag/undo/reopen re-bend them.
# The scenario SAVES: `git checkout -- Projects/Desert/Content/Scenes/G3_TwoTerrains*` after a play.
# The view mode is a MACHINE preference that persists between runs (M28_Jacket.scn leaves it on Wireframe):
# state it, or the slab is drawn as triangle outlines (meshes honour Wireframe, the landscape does not).
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Open Scene G3_TwoTerrains.desce"
Дано run Landscape "Sculpt mode"
Дано run Landscape "Tool: Splines"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 6300,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 12300,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Когда run Landscape "Spline mesh: engine Cube slab 400 x 20 cm"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,13000,-1906
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда state
Тогда-вид 0_mesh a continuous flat grey slab follows the curved road from end to end, no gaps between pieces
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.55,0.84
Когда state
Тогда-вид 0b_mesh_side the slab lies on the road across the hill, following its slope, no gaps
# Drag the middle point 800 cm sideways (+Z): select it at the viewport centre, move it to the new centre.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1906
Когда run Landscape "Spline: select control point at viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1106
Когда run Landscape "Spline: move selected control point to viewport centre"
Когда run Landscape "Spline: deselect"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,13000,-1906
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда state
Тогда-вид 1_drag the slab re-bent along the new curve, its middle 800 cm to the side, still continuous
# Undo before the save (reopening a scene starts a fresh history), then Redo to save the dragged road.
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 3_undo the slab back on the original curve (identical to 0_mesh)
Когда run Action "Redo"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene G3_TwoTerrains.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,13000,-1906
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда state
Тогда-вид 2_reopen identical to 1_drag after the saved scene is reopened
